{"seq":4,"slug":"serverless-operations","title":"运维实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"serverless-monitoring","title":"Serverless 监控与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/serverless-monitoring","wordCount":1498,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"serverless-security","title":"Serverless 安全实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/serverless-security","wordCount":1634,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization","title":"Serverless 成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/serverless-architecture/serverless-operations/cost-optimization","wordCount":1948,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"运维实践-简介\">运维实践 简介</h1><p>本章聚焦无服务器应用的生产运维能力，从监控调试到安全管理再到成本优化，帮助读者构建 Serverless 应用的全方位运维保障体系。</p>\n<p><strong>无服务器监控与调试</strong>讲解 Serverless 环境下的监控挑战与解决方案，包括分布式追踪、结构化日志、CloudWatch 指标分析以及本地调试的工具与方法。</p>\n<p><strong>安全与权限管理</strong>介绍 Serverless 应用的安全最佳实践，包括最小权限的 IAM 策略设计、函数执行环境的安全加固和敏感数据的保护方法。</p>\n<p><strong>成本优化与容量规划</strong>分析 Serverless 的成本构成与计费模型，讲解函数执行时间优化、内存配置调优和架构层面的成本控制策略。</p>\n<p>建议读者在应用上线前建立完善的监控体系，将安全设计融入开发流程，并持续关注成本优化实现长期的经济效益。</p>\n"}